:''For the unique enemy introduced in these stages, [[Wicked Tank Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Wicked Tank''' (タンクネコの解放, ''Tanku Neko no Kaihō'', '''Unleashing the Tank Cat''') is one of the [[Empress' Research]] maps, appearing only after [[Servant of Darkness]] has been cleared in full. Upon completion, 50 [[Cat Food]] will be received as a [[Catnip Challenges|mission]] reward. It is one of the three maps that are required to unlock [[The Gates of Aku|Unleashing the Cats]], the others being [[Wicked Cat]] and [[Wicked Axe]]. This event was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]].

